5:T44b,In the Nikunj, the divine couple is sitting together and Radharani seems to be in a good mood. At this time, Bihariji says to Priyaji Oh my most beloved Pyari, we both are residents of here and keep on enjoying each others company since ages so you keep on showering your love and kindness on me. It is due to you that I have got the name Kunj Bihari. Your love for me and my love for you is immeasurable. There are vibrating tones of music which enrich our love for each other. Every time I feel a new pleasure in your company. When Bihariji looks at the face of Radharani even the moon feels ashamed. Swami Shri Haridas Ji who was present there and listening to them smiled and commented ‘both of you are equal in beauty I cannot say who is more beautiful than the other and further commented that Radharani is expert in dancing and Bihariji loves to watch her dancing because it suits her slender figure and each part of her body is so beautiful hence it is natural that Bihariji will love to watch her dancing and Bihariji thanked her for being so kind to him by showing her dance performance.7:["slug","shri-haridas-kelimal-12","d"]
0:["Xt0P2co0XkF6MKDXqPjpt",[[["",{"children":["hi",{"children":["saints",{"children":[["slug","shri-haridas-kelimal-12","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"shri-haridas-kelimal-12\"}",{}]}]}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["hi",{"children":["saints",{"children":[["slug","shri-haridas-kelimal-12","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"श्री हरिदास, केलिमाल (12)\",\"alternateName\":\"shri haridas, kelimal (12)\",\"description\":\"ब्रज परंपरा के वैष्णव संत।\",\"url\":\"https://path.vrindopnishad.in/hi/saints/shri-haridas-kelimal-12\",\"knowsAbout\":[\"Vaishnavism\",\"Bhakti Yoga\",\"Braj Rasik Heritage\",\"Vrindavan\"]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"मुख्यपृष्ठ\",\"item\":\"https://path.vrindopnishad.in/hi\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"संत\",\"item\":\"https://path.vrindopnishad.in/hi/saints\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"श्री हरिदास, केलिमाल (12)\",\"item\":\"https://path.vrindopnishad.in/hi/saints/shri-haridas-kelimal-12\"}]}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pt-4 mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-white/50 select-none","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/hi","className":"hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors","children":"मुख्यपृष्ठ"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"→"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/hi/saints","className":"hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors","children":"संत"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/80 font-medium truncate","children":"श्री हरिदास, केलिमाल (12)"}]]}],["$","$L3",null,{"children":["$","$L4",null,{"initialSaint":{"name":"श्री हरिदास, केलिमाल (12)","hinglishName":"shri haridas, kelimal (12)","slug":"shri-haridas-kelimal-12","biography":"","metadata":{"lineageEn":"Haridasi Sampradaya (Sakhi Sampradaya)","lineageHi":"हरिदासी संप्रदाय (सखी संप्रदाय)","timelineEn":"1478–1573 AD (Vikram Samvat 1535 - 1630)","timelineHi":"1478–1573 ईस्वी (विक्रम संवत 1535 - 1630)","associatedPlacesEn":"Nidhivan, Vrindavan","associatedPlacesHi":"निधिवन, वृंदावन","discipleOfEn":"Shri Ashudhir Dev Ji (his father and guru)","discipleOfHi":"श्री आशुधीर देव जी (पिता एवं गुरु)","influencedByEn":"Nimbarka Sampradaya philosophy","influencedByHi":"निम्बार्क संप्रदाय सिद्धांत","associatedSampradayaEn":"Haridasi Sampradaya (Sakhi Sampradaya)","associatedSampradayaHi":"हरिदासी संप्रदाय (सखी संप्रदाय)","devotionalMoodEn":"Nitya Vihar, Sakhi Bhava (Lalita Sakhi incarnate)","devotionalMoodHi":"नित्य विहार, सखी भाव (ललिता सखी अवतार)","teachingsEn":"Worship of the Divine Couple in the mood of Lalita Sakhi; focused purely on the eternal love-play (Nitya Vihar) in the secluded bowers (Nikunj) of Vrindavan, entirely devoid of majesty (aishwarya) or physical separation (viraha).","teachingsHi":"ललिता सखी के भाव में युगल उपासना; वृंदावन के निकुंजों में होने वाले अखंड नित्य विहार रस पर पूर्ण ध्यान, जिसमें ऐश्वर्य भाव या वियोग का कोई स्थान नहीं है।","literaryStyleEn":"Composed Kelimal (केलिमाल) and Siddhanta Pada (सिद्धान्त के पद) in sweet Braj Bhasha, characterized by deep musicality, classical raag notations, and intimate description of the Divine Couple's pastimes.","literaryStyleHi":"मधुर ब्रजभाषा में 'केलिमाल' और 'सिद्धान्त के पद' की रचना की, जो राग-रागिनियों की शास्त्रीय विधा और निकुंज लीलाओं के सूक्ष्म चित्रण से परिपूर्ण हैं।","biographyEn":"Swami Haridas was a spiritual master, classical music pioneer, and the founding acharya of the Haridasi Sampradaya. He is widely revered as the direct incarnation of Lalita Sakhi, the chief confidante of Srimati Radharani. Swami Haridas performed his intense bhajan in the sacred grove of Nidhivan in Vrindavan. His musical devotion was so deep and pure that the Divine Couple, Shri Radha and Krishna, appeared before him and manifested themselves in a single, combined deity form—Sri Bankey Bihari Ji. Swami Haridas taught that the ultimate spiritual destination is not cosmic liberation or majestic worship, but witnessing the confidential loving service of the Divine Couple in the eternal groves of Braj.","biographyHi":"स्वामी हरिदास वृंदावन के रसिक शिरोमणि संत और भारतीय शास्त्रीय संगीत के महान आचार्य थे। उन्हें श्री राधा जी की प्रधान सखी श्री ललिता जी का साक्षात् अवतार माना जाता है। उन्होंने वृंदावन के निधिवन को अपनी साधना स्थली बनाया, जहाँ उनके संगीत अनुराग से खिंचकर युगल सरकार ने बांके बिहारी जी के रूप में प्रकट होकर दर्शन दिए। तानसेन और बैजू बावरा जैसे संगीत सम्राट इनके शिष्य थे। स्वामी जी ने सिद्ध किया कि भक्ति शुष्क तपस्या नहीं, बल्कि राग-रागिनियों के माध्यम से प्रभु चरणों में पूर्ण आत्मसमर्पण है।","relatedSaints":[{"nameEn":"Shri Hit Harivansh","nameHi":"श्री हित हरिवंश","slug":"hit-harivansh"},{"nameEn":"Shri Hariram Vyas","nameHi":"श्री हरिराम व्यास","slug":"hariram-vyas"}],"relatedGranthas":[{"nameEn":"Kelimal","nameHi":"केलिमाल","slug":"kelimal"},{"nameEn":"Siddhanta Pada","nameHi":"सिद्धान्त के पद","slug":"siddhanta-pada"}],"associatedGlossary":[{"termEn":"Nitya Vihar","termHi":"नित्य विहार","slug":"nitya-vihar"},{"termEn":"Nikunj","termHi":"निकुंज","slug":"nikunj"},{"termEn":"Sakhi Bhava","termHi":"सखी भाव","slug":"sakhi-bhava"}],"faq":[{"qEn":"Who was Swami Haridas?","aEn":"Swami Haridas was a 16th-century rasik saint, musicologist, and founder of the Haridasi Sampradaya, renowned for manifesting the Bankey Bihari deity through his music in Nidhivan.","qHi":"स्वामी हरिदास कौन थे?","aHi":"स्वामी हरिदास 16वीं शताब्दी के एक महान रसिक संत, संगीतकार और हरिदासी संप्रदाय के प्रवर्तक थे, जिन्होंने अपने संगीत साधना से निधिवन में ठाकुर बांके बिहारी जी को प्रकट किया था।"},{"qEn":"Who were the famous disciples of Swami Haridas?","aEn":"The legendary musicians Tansen (the royal singer of Akbar's court) and Baiju Bawra were disciples of Swami Haridas.","qHi":"स्वामी हरिदास के प्रसिद्ध शिष्य कौन थे?","aHi":"अकबर के दरबार के नवरत्नों में से एक संगीत सम्राट तानसेन और बैजू बावरा स्वामी हरिदास जी के प्रमुख शिष्य थे।"}]},"imageUrl":null,"verses":[{"id":"local-319","title":"कुंजबिहारी हौं तेरी बलाइ","category":"Shloka","sanskrit_text":"कुंजबिहारी हौं तेरी बलाइलेऊँ नीके हौ गावत।राग रागिनीन के जूथ उपजावत।।तैसीयै तैसी मिली जोरीप्रिया जू की मुख देखत चंद लजावत।श्रीहरिदास के स्वामी स्यामा कौनृत्य देखत काहि न भावत।।","hindi_text":"कुंजबिहारी की भावना है प्यारी जी आप मुझे अंग संग कर कुंजों विहार कर रही हैं , मैं आप की बलायें यानि बलिहारी पर लेता हूँ, आप अपनी कृपालुता बरसाती रहें , आप इसी भांति रहें , बोलें , गाती रहें । आप के आलिंगन से अनेक मनोरथ पूर्ण होते हैं , नये उपजते भी उपजते हैं । सखी बोली - प्रिया जी की मुख चन्द्र के आगे लाल जी का मुख चन्द्र फीका प्रतीत हो रहा है । प्रिया जी के अंग के सम्मुख प्रिय का अंग दब गया है या कहीं छिप गया है । हरिदासी सखी यहाँ सुख विलास रति में किन का नृत्य विशेष है , दर्शाना चाह रही हैं । श्री श्यामा जी का नृत्य श्वास है , यह सुन श्री श्याम जी प्रसन्नता से बोल पड़े , आप की कृपा से श्यामा प्यारी जी नृत्य कर रही हैं , सो मैं बलि बलि जाऊँ ।","english_text":null,"english_translation":"$5","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/59a1bdc359e8c72a534d85b5/kunjbihari-haun-teree-balaee-leun-pad-by-swami-shri-haridas-ji","author":"श्री हरिदास, केलिमाल (12)","status":"published","content_text":"(राग कान्हरौ)\nकुंजबिहारी हौं तेरी बलाइ\nलेऊँ नीके हौ गावत।\nराग रागिनीन के जूथ उपजावत।।\nतैसीयै तैसी मिली जोरी\nप्रिया जू की मुख देखत चंद लजावत।\nश्रीहरिदास के स्वामी स्यामा कौ\nनृत्य देखत काहि न भावत।।\n- श्री हरिदास, केलिमाल (12)\nकुंजबिहारी की भावना है प्यारी जी आप मुझे अंग संग कर कुंजों विहार कर रही हैं , मैं आप की बलायें यानि बलिहारी पर लेता हूँ, आप अपनी कृपालुता बरसाती रहें , आप इसी भांति रहें , बोलें , गाती रहें । आप के आलिंगन से अनेक मनोरथ पूर्ण होते हैं , नये उपजते भी उपजते हैं । सखी बोली - प्रिया जी की मुख चन्द्र के आगे लाल जी का मुख चन्द्र फीका प्रतीत हो रहा है । प्रिया जी के अंग के सम्मुख प्रिय का अंग दब गया है या कहीं छिप गया है । हरिदासी सखी यहाँ सुख विलास रति में किन का नृत्य विशेष है , दर्शाना चाह रही हैं । श्री श्यामा जी का नृत्य श्वास है , यह सुन श्री श्याम जी प्रसन्नता से बोल पड़े , आप की कृपा से श्यामा प्यारी जी नृत्य कर रही हैं , सो मैं बलि बलि जाऊँ ।","tags":["Braj Rasik","Mass Import"],"image_urls":[],"video_urls":[],"media_links":[],"source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/59a1bdc359e8c72a534d85b5/kunjbihari-haun-teree-balaee-leun-pad-by-swami-shri-haridas-ji","slug":"kunjabihari-haun-teri-balai"}],"books":[],"rawItem":null}}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L6",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","saints","children","$7","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L8",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[null,["$","$L6",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","saints","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L8",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[null,["$","div",null,{"lang":"hi","children":["$","$L6",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L8",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]}]],null],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/cbf73327883ccb7f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","1",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/fe995a1e4635138b.css","precedence":"next","cr